WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:39.460 --> 01:42.300
[Episode 26]

01:42.560 --> 01:45.290
Even if only you and I remain,

01:45.760 --> 01:46.740
I would gladly accept it.

01:49.710 --> 01:50.620
Li Changshou,

02:12.120 --> 02:13.100
I have a question for you.

02:13.960 --> 02:15.260
Answer me truthfully.

02:16.960 --> 02:17.570
Now,

02:18.000 --> 02:20.130
I've ended all your troubles.

02:21.030 --> 02:21.890
From this day on,

02:22.240 --> 02:23.780
none will covet the Pregenesis Sword;

02:24.590 --> 02:26.340
none can threaten us again.

02:28.960 --> 02:30.100
If I were to say now

02:31.520 --> 02:32.820
that I want to spend my life

02:33.630 --> 02:35.060
with you,

02:40.670 --> 02:44.000
♪Someone has unsettled your heart♪

02:44.000 --> 02:44.940
will you accept me?

02:47.520 --> 02:48.290
I...

02:50.510 --> 02:57.020
♪Making me lean down and confirm slowly♪

02:58.750 --> 03:01.770
♪Not knowing what love truly is♪

03:01.770 --> 03:03.780
♪Just as it was at first♪

03:05.430 --> 03:08.570
Bow to each other as a married couple.

03:08.570 --> 03:12.360
♪At storm's end, stars gleam,
and clouds drift♪

03:12.360 --> 03:16.630
♪Together we smile,
watching moonrise and sunset♪

03:26.000 --> 03:29.340
East Sea Dragon Clan, blood for blood!

03:41.520 --> 03:42.890
Little Uncle.

03:44.280 --> 03:45.500
Little Prince.

03:45.520 --> 03:46.410
Little Prince.

03:48.750 --> 03:49.500
Senior

03:50.310 --> 03:51.060
Hanzhi...

04:04.120 --> 04:04.760
Little Prince.

04:05.090 --> 04:05.720
Little Prince!

04:06.420 --> 04:10.060
[A few days ago]

04:28.220 --> 04:29.000
[Tranquil and Void]

04:29.000 --> 04:31.340
Rock, paper, scissors!

04:31.360 --> 04:32.540
Rock, paper, scissors!

04:35.000 --> 04:36.140
You lost!

04:38.720 --> 04:39.490
Here, stick this on.

04:39.870 --> 04:40.810
Mentor.

04:41.270 --> 04:42.220
Come on, let's go again.

04:43.360 --> 04:44.250
Little Uncle.

04:44.270 --> 04:45.100
Rock, paper, scissors!

04:45.160 --> 04:46.460
Cansheng.

04:47.190 --> 04:49.250
I'm all alone again.

05:01.510 --> 05:02.290
Who's there?

05:03.510 --> 05:04.290
Who is it?

05:04.720 --> 05:05.930
Who dares trespass on my Turtle Island?

05:17.310 --> 05:18.100
Cansheng?

05:22.920 --> 05:24.290
Is it really you, Cansheng?

05:27.750 --> 05:28.980
Where have you been?

05:29.000 --> 05:30.340
I was worried sick about you.

05:30.360 --> 05:31.850
I thought you were all dead,

05:32.240 --> 05:33.780
leaving me all alone again.

05:34.600 --> 05:35.460
Senior.

05:37.270 --> 05:38.490
You can speak now?

05:42.510 --> 05:43.780
I met someone.

05:45.800 --> 05:46.580
He said

05:50.830 --> 05:52.370
he can help us get revenge.

05:54.510 --> 05:55.290
Revenge?

06:01.830 --> 06:03.340
Avenge ourselves

06:04.000 --> 06:04.780
on the Dragon Clan.

06:07.560 --> 06:09.580
I'll boost your magical power

06:10.630 --> 06:12.250
and make arrangements for you.

06:12.830 --> 06:13.610
Thank you.

06:20.630 --> 06:21.410
Rise.

06:23.070 --> 06:23.850
But first,

06:25.040 --> 06:26.900
you must lure someone for me.

06:35.720 --> 06:37.170
Why isn't Senior back yet?

06:38.120 --> 06:38.850
Senior?

06:51.120 --> 06:51.810
Senior?

06:52.240 --> 06:53.460
Senior, I'm here!

07:00.630 --> 07:01.490
What are you doing?

07:09.720 --> 07:10.410
Careful!

07:29.510 --> 07:30.700
An assassin!

07:31.680 --> 07:34.250
Pearl Elites,
seize the assassin with me.

07:55.870 --> 07:57.410
Jin Chan.

07:57.830 --> 07:58.370
You...

08:02.870 --> 08:04.250
Do not draw attention.

08:05.040 --> 08:06.700
Wait for the right moment.

08:12.000 --> 08:12.810
Yi!

08:14.310 --> 08:16.020
Guards, seize her!

08:16.040 --> 08:18.220
Little Uncle! Little Uncle!

08:36.630 --> 08:38.460
Dragon King, is this your scheme too?

08:38.510 --> 08:39.610
This is not the Dragon King's doing.

08:40.200 --> 08:41.180
He seeks balance.

08:41.200 --> 08:42.490
He would not harm the Little Prince.

08:42.630 --> 08:43.610
Who is this person?

08:43.630 --> 08:44.940
Why strike at my son?

08:44.960 --> 08:47.010
She knew the Little Prince

08:47.030 --> 08:48.250
as his senior in the Human Clan.

08:48.600 --> 08:50.530
You brought her into the Dragon Palace?

08:50.630 --> 08:51.850
We had no idea she was here.

08:51.910 --> 08:54.220
The Dragon Palace has one gate.

08:54.630 --> 08:55.730
For the past half month,

08:56.000 --> 08:58.580
the Water Dragon Spout
only brought you in.

08:58.600 --> 08:59.250
Perhaps

08:59.550 --> 09:00.820
she had already hidden here

09:01.000 --> 09:01.700
half a month ago

09:01.720 --> 09:03.180
like Bian Zhuang.

09:03.200 --> 09:03.980
Impossible.

09:04.600 --> 09:06.300
If she had hidden for half a month,

09:06.440 --> 09:08.130
she could not escape my eyes.

09:08.960 --> 09:10.340
If it was before that,

09:10.360 --> 09:11.820
Bian Zhuang would have seen her.

09:12.150 --> 09:13.820
Yet he never mentioned her.

09:13.840 --> 09:15.650
Then when did she get in?

09:15.670 --> 09:16.340
Wait.

09:17.480 --> 09:18.890
Before we entered the Dragon Palace,

09:18.910 --> 09:20.700
you opened the Water Dragon Spout once.

09:20.720 --> 09:21.530
When was that?

09:21.720 --> 09:23.700
When the dragon guards
reported Ao Yi's return.

09:24.120 --> 09:26.650
She must have posed as a dragon guard.

09:26.650 --> 09:27.580
[Token]

09:33.840 --> 09:35.010
The Little Prince is coming back.

09:35.030 --> 09:36.420
I'll go inform His Majesty at once.

09:36.510 --> 09:38.180
You've worked hard. Go rest early.

09:38.200 --> 09:38.820
Yes.

09:44.030 --> 09:44.820
Follow me.

09:47.080 --> 09:49.300
Her magical power is weak.
She wouldn't come alone.

09:49.320 --> 09:51.490
Someone inside must be aiding her.

09:51.510 --> 09:52.770
Within the Dragon Palace,

09:53.030 --> 09:55.340
who wants her to murder His Highness?

09:56.150 --> 09:56.940
Jin Chan.

09:57.390 --> 09:58.340
You've indeed

09:58.630 --> 10:00.460
betrayed the Two Saints.

10:06.030 --> 10:06.890
How can this be?

10:13.440 --> 10:14.770
To the great Way of the world,

10:15.200 --> 10:16.300
emptiness is fullness.

10:16.440 --> 10:20.610
No virtue is virtue; no Way is Way.

10:20.840 --> 10:22.300
No face or form

10:22.790 --> 10:23.460
is

10:24.080 --> 10:25.820
thousand faces and forms.

10:36.600 --> 10:39.130
I saved him from the python's jaws.

10:41.240 --> 10:42.730
His soul and spirit are broken.

10:43.120 --> 10:44.460
He is but a walking husk.

10:45.240 --> 10:46.610
I remade him myself.

10:47.390 --> 10:48.420
The man he is now

10:48.790 --> 10:50.940
knows no pain or fear.

10:51.550 --> 10:52.250
He cannot die.

10:52.750 --> 10:54.010
Nor can he truly live.

10:56.000 --> 10:58.370
He became the finest corpse vessel.

10:59.630 --> 11:01.490
Only one thing remains in him:

11:04.440 --> 11:05.220
hatred.

11:10.480 --> 11:11.580
As for you,

11:12.270 --> 11:12.940
killing you

11:14.320 --> 11:16.530
costs much spiritual power.

11:17.840 --> 11:19.340
I cannot spare it now.

11:20.440 --> 11:21.940
But if what happened here

11:22.840 --> 11:24.650
reaches the Two Saints,

11:25.550 --> 11:27.530
what fate would await

11:28.790 --> 11:30.220
your kin in the Blood Sea?

11:37.030 --> 11:38.180
Congratulations.

11:40.000 --> 11:41.650
Westdawn Sect's great cause nears.

11:42.960 --> 11:44.010
Time to choose

11:45.840 --> 11:46.980
your side.

11:55.550 --> 11:57.820
Didn't you say you killed Jin Chan?

11:57.840 --> 11:58.940
Are you sure?

11:59.360 --> 12:00.420
Little rascal's plan

12:00.440 --> 12:01.220
is sure to be foolproof.

12:01.240 --> 12:02.220
I am asking him.

12:05.750 --> 12:07.580
My mole by Jin Chan's side

12:08.080 --> 12:09.100
still hasn't answered.

12:10.030 --> 12:10.820
I don't know.

12:11.000 --> 12:11.850
You don't know?

12:12.240 --> 12:13.100
My original plan

12:13.120 --> 12:14.770
was to take out all Jin Chan's pawns,

12:14.790 --> 12:15.850
leaving him no way out.

12:16.670 --> 12:18.490
But if he's a hidden trump I don't know,

12:18.910 --> 12:19.300
then...

12:19.320 --> 12:20.610
Even if it truly is Jin Chan's doing,

12:20.630 --> 12:22.820
why would he have her

12:22.840 --> 12:24.010
try to kill Ao Yi now?

12:24.440 --> 12:26.490
Is he still wooing
the East Sea Dragon Clan?

12:26.870 --> 12:27.490
This is bad.

12:27.510 --> 12:28.770
We were lured away.

12:31.790 --> 12:32.580
Where are you going?

12:33.270 --> 12:35.220
Jin Chan was never after Ao Yi.

12:35.270 --> 12:36.730
He only wanted to draw us away

12:36.750 --> 12:38.490
to seize the Sword fragment
in the chaos.

12:38.510 --> 12:39.580
Then what are you going to do?

12:40.270 --> 12:41.730
Jin Chan is a man of schemes.

12:42.080 --> 12:43.490
If he sways Ao Guang with words,

12:43.510 --> 12:44.610
we'll be in grave danger.

12:45.030 --> 12:45.820
But

12:46.960 --> 12:47.700
with your strength,

12:48.080 --> 12:49.130
if you go alone,

12:49.150 --> 12:50.220
can you stand against the Dragon King?

12:51.440 --> 12:52.340
Within the East Sea,

12:53.000 --> 12:54.490
only I can restrain the Dragon King.

12:55.270 --> 12:56.220
You cannot go.

12:56.240 --> 12:57.580
You carry a Sword fragment.

13:08.840 --> 13:09.700
So, this time,

13:12.480 --> 13:13.300
you must stay behind.

13:14.550 --> 13:15.610
Do not think

13:15.630 --> 13:17.730
only you can bear it all.

13:18.030 --> 13:19.340
When I first bore my fate,

13:19.630 --> 13:20.820
you were not even reborn yet.

13:21.960 --> 13:22.730
Yunxiao.

13:30.080 --> 13:30.850
Watch out.

13:32.120 --> 13:32.890
Do not worry.

13:33.670 --> 13:34.850
I'm Seizing Sect's war goddess.

13:36.320 --> 13:37.100
Trust me.

13:49.480 --> 13:50.460
Hold them all down.

13:50.510 --> 13:51.530
This woman is deeply guilty.

13:51.550 --> 13:52.420
She's beyond forgiveness.

13:52.440 --> 13:53.650
Do not let her run. Hold her.

13:54.750 --> 13:56.300
Your clan harmed so many

13:56.320 --> 13:57.460
and ruined so much land.

13:57.550 --> 13:59.730
Who is truly beyond forgiveness?

14:00.080 --> 14:01.100
You are framing me.

14:01.120 --> 14:01.820
Bah.

14:03.630 --> 14:05.340
Young lady, mind your manners.

14:05.360 --> 14:06.010
Besides,

14:06.030 --> 14:08.060
what does that have to do with me?

14:08.440 --> 14:09.530
I'm a turtle.

14:10.670 --> 14:12.610
Your clan destroyed my people

14:13.390 --> 14:15.220
and killed my Little Uncle.

14:15.360 --> 14:16.100
Insolence!

14:31.630 --> 14:32.610
This girl...

14:32.910 --> 14:34.340
Princess Jiang Si'er?

14:34.670 --> 14:35.820
No. What is happening?

14:36.390 --> 14:37.220
Get up. Get up!

14:37.240 --> 14:38.010
My legs!

14:51.960 --> 14:52.700
Ao Yi.

14:55.600 --> 14:56.370
Si'er.

15:00.670 --> 15:01.460
Jia.

15:04.240 --> 15:05.060
I won.

15:05.630 --> 15:06.420
Now,

15:08.120 --> 15:09.220
I cast you off.

15:13.480 --> 15:16.580
By His Majesty's decree, Jiang Si'er

15:16.600 --> 15:19.060
will marry Second Prince Ao Yi
of East Sea.

15:21.480 --> 15:22.980
How did it come to this?

15:23.670 --> 15:25.220
It never used to be like this.

15:28.240 --> 15:29.300
Jiang Si'er.

15:31.000 --> 15:32.650
We were so close.

15:32.960 --> 15:34.420
Have you forgotten?

15:35.360 --> 15:36.130
Who?

15:42.030 --> 15:42.700
Si'er.

15:46.200 --> 15:46.940
Ao Jia.

15:46.960 --> 15:47.770
How shameless!

15:48.240 --> 15:50.220
You used low tricks to stop my wedding!

15:51.720 --> 15:52.610
Why are you here?

15:52.840 --> 15:53.820
You know perfectly well.

15:53.840 --> 15:54.770
Explain yourself clearly.

15:54.790 --> 15:56.370
I must have been blind.

15:56.600 --> 15:58.220
I once thought you were a hero.

15:58.270 --> 16:00.100
Now, you're just a scoundrel.

16:00.960 --> 16:01.490
I...

16:04.510 --> 16:05.370
What are you talking about?

16:11.360 --> 16:12.610
Seize her!

16:12.630 --> 16:13.370
Stop!

16:14.270 --> 16:15.060
Si'er.

16:16.790 --> 16:17.370
Your Highness.

16:17.390 --> 16:17.730
Step back.

16:17.750 --> 16:18.580
It's dangerous!

16:18.870 --> 16:19.820
Your Highness.

16:20.030 --> 16:20.940
Step back!

16:24.150 --> 16:24.890
Why

16:26.080 --> 16:27.180
did you insult me?

16:27.480 --> 16:28.580
She insulted the First Prince.

16:28.600 --> 16:29.370
That's unforgivable!

16:29.390 --> 16:30.610
Gag her!

16:30.750 --> 16:31.820
Did I ask you?

16:35.360 --> 16:36.100
Why

16:37.480 --> 16:38.370
are you here?

16:38.390 --> 16:39.530
Why did you attack me?

16:39.960 --> 16:42.060
Why call me a shameless scoundrel?

16:42.080 --> 16:43.940
Explain them

16:44.270 --> 16:45.180
one by one.

16:45.320 --> 16:46.370
You really don't know?

16:46.390 --> 16:48.250
No more questions. Tell me.

16:48.480 --> 16:50.580
You plotted with Westdawn Sect secretly.

16:50.720 --> 16:52.300
You betrayed the Dragon Palace
of the East Sea

16:52.670 --> 16:54.130
and abducted me here.

16:54.320 --> 16:55.530
What are you plotting?

16:56.000 --> 16:57.820
Can anyone explain this to me?

16:57.870 --> 16:58.530
Still making excuses?

16:58.960 --> 16:59.980
You still won't admit it?

17:00.670 --> 17:02.980
I abducted you?
I betrayed the Dragon Palace?

17:03.200 --> 17:04.180
When did I ever...

17:07.310 --> 17:08.050
Seize her.

17:08.070 --> 17:08.860
Ao Jia.

17:10.030 --> 17:10.900
Your Highness.

17:11.510 --> 17:12.570
Do not be deceived.

17:15.110 --> 17:17.050
She is not Princess Jiang Si'er.

17:18.790 --> 17:20.730
So, it was you.

17:21.750 --> 17:23.140
Princess, you honor me too much.

17:23.160 --> 17:24.380
It is not just me.

17:24.790 --> 17:26.420
It's everyone here.

17:30.310 --> 17:31.010
Your Highness.

17:31.030 --> 17:32.530
Do not listen to him.

17:32.550 --> 17:33.180
Who am I?

17:33.200 --> 17:33.980
- Your Highness.
- Who am I?

17:34.790 --> 17:35.530
Your Highness.

17:36.110 --> 17:38.010
At the Crystal Palace,
Princess Jiang Si'er

17:38.030 --> 17:39.530
turned her back on you.

17:39.550 --> 17:39.860
Yes.

17:39.880 --> 17:40.420
Ao Jia.

17:40.440 --> 17:41.140
They all turned on me.

17:41.160 --> 17:42.570
- Don't listen to him.
- You all turned on me.

17:42.590 --> 17:43.860
Remember who you are.

17:44.030 --> 17:45.380
Do not become someone's puppet.

17:45.480 --> 17:46.250
Puppet?

17:46.270 --> 17:49.330
- What is a puppet?
- The Little Prince is ungrateful.

17:49.350 --> 17:51.180
He is marrying Princess Jiang Si'er now.

17:51.200 --> 17:51.620
Ao Jia.

17:51.640 --> 17:52.730
- Marrying?
- Don't listen to him.

17:52.750 --> 17:55.010
- She is marrying him?
- You are the First Prince.

17:55.030 --> 17:55.980
Pull yourself together.

17:56.000 --> 17:58.250
What are you talking about?

17:58.270 --> 18:00.090
This person is wanted in East Sea.

18:00.110 --> 18:01.250
She's good at enchanting men.

18:01.270 --> 18:03.010
Your Highness, be careful!

18:03.030 --> 18:03.420
Your Highness.

18:04.270 --> 18:04.860
Your Highness.

18:05.920 --> 18:06.730
Your Highness.

18:07.160 --> 18:08.380
I'm Jiang Si'er.

18:08.960 --> 18:09.530
Your Highness.

18:09.920 --> 18:11.660
I'm Jiang Si'er, Your Highness.

18:11.680 --> 18:12.940
Please remember me.

18:13.350 --> 18:14.250
Your Highness.

18:14.270 --> 18:15.770
- Remember me!
- Shut up!

18:17.920 --> 18:19.250
You lied to me.

18:19.270 --> 18:19.980
That's not true.

18:20.000 --> 18:22.090
- Yes, she lied to you.
- Remember me!

18:22.440 --> 18:24.090
- You lied to me.
- That's not true.

18:24.110 --> 18:24.700
Your Highness.

18:24.720 --> 18:26.380
Kill her.

18:27.110 --> 18:27.900
Kill her.

18:28.350 --> 18:29.010
Kill her.

18:29.200 --> 18:30.460
Kill her.

18:30.680 --> 18:31.660
Kill her.

18:31.680 --> 18:32.530
Yes.

18:32.550 --> 18:34.250
Strike!

18:34.440 --> 18:34.940
Your Highness.

18:34.960 --> 18:35.770
Strike!

18:35.790 --> 18:37.900
Strike!

18:39.110 --> 18:41.140
Strike! Strike!

18:41.160 --> 18:42.290
Your Highness.

18:42.640 --> 18:44.090
Strike!

18:44.920 --> 18:46.460
Strike! Strike!

18:46.480 --> 18:48.900
Strike!

18:56.790 --> 18:58.290
So, with these demonic arts,

18:58.310 --> 19:00.420
you controlled me for ten years

19:00.440 --> 19:01.380
and made me crave blood

19:01.400 --> 19:02.490
and hunger for slaughter.

19:03.270 --> 19:04.380
Is that it?

19:05.880 --> 19:08.770
Did you think a true East Sea dragon

19:08.790 --> 19:11.380
would not see through your tricks?

19:12.240 --> 19:15.180
Before you die, hear this:

19:15.790 --> 19:19.180
Never look down on the Dragon Clan.

19:58.680 --> 19:59.700
So, these past ten years,

20:00.550 --> 20:01.980
you've been under their control.

20:04.510 --> 20:05.570
So, these past ten years,

20:07.440 --> 20:08.570
I truly wasn't myself.

20:09.400 --> 20:10.180
It's okay.

20:11.200 --> 20:12.140
From this day on,

20:12.590 --> 20:13.530
you are yourself again.

20:14.240 --> 20:15.010
Si'er,

20:16.400 --> 20:17.330
I'm truly sorry.

20:18.240 --> 20:19.810
I made too many mistakes.

20:22.510 --> 20:23.660
We'll break out together

20:24.030 --> 20:24.940
and save the East Sea.

20:35.000 --> 20:35.900
The enemy is upon us.

20:37.030 --> 20:38.220
Why are you staring at me?

20:42.640 --> 20:43.570
I just think

20:45.200 --> 20:46.380
this feels so familiar.

20:46.880 --> 20:48.380
It reminds me of the cultivation art

20:48.830 --> 20:49.980
we practiced here.

20:51.720 --> 20:52.490
Do you remember it all?

20:54.240 --> 20:55.010
It's been ten years.

20:56.240 --> 20:57.460
How could I ever forget?

21:56.200 --> 21:57.700
Master Jin Chan.

21:57.920 --> 21:59.620
It was you after all.

21:59.920 --> 22:00.810
Your Majesty.

22:01.680 --> 22:02.860
Long time no see.

22:04.550 --> 22:07.290
As I recall, in our last meeting,

22:08.030 --> 22:09.290
our places

22:10.510 --> 22:12.180
seemed quite reversed.

22:13.480 --> 22:17.810
You lured me to catch Lan Ling'e

22:18.350 --> 22:21.250
and set me against Ascendance Sect.

22:21.640 --> 22:23.180
When two sides clash,

22:23.880 --> 22:25.380
the watcher takes the prize.

22:25.720 --> 22:27.730
You deceived us with a false death.

22:28.000 --> 22:31.090
Yet you plotted in the shadows.

22:32.200 --> 22:33.290
Without a false death,

22:34.310 --> 22:35.220
how could I fool

22:35.240 --> 22:37.570
two top masterminds behind the scenes?

22:39.110 --> 22:40.420
Do you not fear that I

22:40.440 --> 22:43.700
will make that death real today?

22:45.160 --> 22:46.380
Do you truly think

22:47.240 --> 22:48.380
you can do that?

22:54.640 --> 22:56.730
The Sword fragment is there.

22:57.550 --> 23:00.220
You may take it yourself.

23:02.270 --> 23:04.900
Is it an ambush or a decoy?

23:05.790 --> 23:06.330
What?

23:07.480 --> 23:08.530
You don't want it?

23:10.030 --> 23:11.940
Then I shall take it away.

23:18.310 --> 23:20.420
If you came for the Sword fragment,

23:20.480 --> 23:22.420
you could leave once you took it.

23:22.590 --> 23:24.220
Why stay here?

23:25.000 --> 23:27.010
So, you must be scheming.

23:31.680 --> 23:33.490
You're truly brilliant.

23:33.790 --> 23:36.770
I cannot help but admire you.

23:37.070 --> 23:38.570
So, I feel compelled

23:39.110 --> 23:40.700
to offer you advice.

23:45.750 --> 23:47.980
You have two paths now:

23:48.270 --> 23:49.180
Take

23:49.400 --> 23:50.180
one step forward

23:51.240 --> 23:52.180
and kill me,

23:52.480 --> 23:53.900
so you can remove the threat forever.

23:54.110 --> 23:54.980
Or

23:56.000 --> 23:57.490
run for your life

23:58.350 --> 23:59.810
while there is still time.

24:02.510 --> 24:02.940
You...

24:05.830 --> 24:07.770
Will you truly open the Eye of the Sea?

24:09.000 --> 24:10.980
You know better than anyone

24:12.000 --> 24:15.420
how dreadful what follows will be.

24:16.030 --> 24:17.770
I still have one magic treasure.

24:17.790 --> 24:20.460
Even an Empyreal Aureate Immortal
may fall.

24:20.640 --> 24:23.050
What magic treasure is he hiding?

24:32.030 --> 24:33.570
Fairy Yunxiao.

24:35.270 --> 24:36.380
It seems you

24:37.070 --> 24:38.700
have a third path now.

24:40.070 --> 24:41.700
Why not step back for now

24:41.880 --> 24:43.290
and let Yunxiao test me?

24:43.550 --> 24:47.090
Then, you'll see
whether I'm truly prepared

24:48.310 --> 24:50.090
or merely putting on a show.

25:05.590 --> 25:06.530
Since you are here,

25:07.110 --> 25:08.090
why not show yourself?

25:08.590 --> 25:09.730
Is it your sect's skill

25:09.920 --> 25:11.900
to skulk in the shadows?

25:17.590 --> 25:19.180
That is why I

25:19.200 --> 25:20.940
dare not show myself.

25:21.440 --> 25:22.770
I know your voice.

25:22.960 --> 25:23.770
Back then,

25:24.310 --> 25:26.980
you lured me to seize
the Sea-Calming Pillar.

25:27.110 --> 25:28.420
Yunxiao, you still remember

25:28.750 --> 25:30.010
that we once joined hands.

25:30.310 --> 25:32.490
I was deeply honored.

25:32.960 --> 25:33.730
Joined hands?

25:34.830 --> 25:36.380
You are just a conceited madman

25:36.440 --> 25:38.770
who used me as a pawn.

25:39.880 --> 25:41.250
You wanted a magic treasure.

25:42.270 --> 25:43.700
I needed support.

25:43.750 --> 25:45.490
We could've each gotten what we wanted.

25:45.680 --> 25:47.900
We should have worked as one.

25:48.200 --> 25:50.660
Unfortunately, you chose the wrong foe.

25:51.310 --> 25:52.660
At Ascendance Sect,

25:52.920 --> 25:55.010
you killed many of my Seizing kin.

25:55.110 --> 25:56.380
Their deaths

25:57.160 --> 25:58.380
were worth it.

25:58.920 --> 25:59.620
Nonsense.

26:05.110 --> 26:06.420
They died

26:07.030 --> 26:08.980
for more people's lives.

26:09.720 --> 26:11.570
They died for the whole Seizing Sect.

26:11.720 --> 26:12.660
What did you say?

26:12.750 --> 26:14.090
Had they not died,

26:14.350 --> 26:16.090
when the Great Tribulation came,

26:16.720 --> 26:17.490
the whole Seizing Sect

26:18.160 --> 26:19.980
would perish.

26:20.160 --> 26:22.180
Come out. Explain yourself.

26:23.920 --> 26:25.700
Why are you so obsessed

26:25.720 --> 26:27.250
with gathering innate magic treasures?

26:27.510 --> 26:29.940
And why did your nature change?

26:30.030 --> 26:31.700
Why have you become more violent?

26:31.960 --> 26:33.620
Who did you meet?

26:33.680 --> 26:35.700
What are you truly afraid of?

26:35.720 --> 26:36.420
Silence.

26:36.440 --> 26:37.090
Silence!

26:37.110 --> 26:39.010
Let me tell you, Yunxiao,

26:39.480 --> 26:41.530
what

26:41.550 --> 26:42.660
your deepest fear is.

27:10.480 --> 27:11.530
A mere formation?

27:18.440 --> 27:19.570
This stone wall...

27:20.240 --> 27:21.380
This formation is

27:22.960 --> 27:24.180
the Nine-Turn Formation.

27:24.350 --> 27:25.860
You have sharp eyes.

27:26.790 --> 27:29.730
It is Trifairy Isle's secret formation.

27:30.110 --> 27:31.860
Only we four siblings can set it.

27:32.750 --> 27:34.380
Where did you steal it from?

27:34.440 --> 27:35.940
When did I ever say

27:36.160 --> 27:38.140
I set this formation?

27:38.550 --> 27:41.940
This is the Trifairy Isle
one year later.

27:44.160 --> 27:44.940
Nonsense.

27:45.240 --> 27:46.900
Bixiao and Qiongxiao wield great power.

27:47.270 --> 27:50.050
Zhao Gongming tops
Seizing Sect's outer sect.

27:50.350 --> 27:51.770
With those three guarding it,

27:51.790 --> 27:53.140
who could breach Trifairy Isle?

27:56.110 --> 27:56.900
Senior!

27:58.480 --> 27:59.250
Senior!

28:04.550 --> 28:05.490
Run!

28:06.070 --> 28:06.860
Run!

28:07.720 --> 28:10.220
Zhao Gongming was trapped
by vile sorcery.

28:10.240 --> 28:13.250
His soul and spirit scattered.
He coughed blood and died.

28:13.590 --> 28:15.090
Nothing could save him.

28:15.480 --> 28:17.090
Senior, how did this happen?

28:17.400 --> 28:18.490
Who did this to you?

28:18.640 --> 28:20.250
Tell me who harmed you.

28:20.480 --> 28:21.140
Go, now.

28:21.590 --> 28:24.140
Your junior, Qiongxiao,
tried to save Zhao Gongming.

28:24.480 --> 28:26.140
She went to seize the Book of Curses,

28:26.960 --> 28:28.620
but a magic treasure struck her.

28:28.960 --> 28:30.250
Her soul was destroyed.

28:32.830 --> 28:33.770
Qiongxiao...

28:35.550 --> 28:36.810
Your young junior, Bixiao,
was overcome with terror.

28:37.400 --> 28:40.290
She begged bitterly for mercy,

28:40.680 --> 28:42.490
yet she was drawn in

28:43.110 --> 28:44.660
by the enemy's treasure.

28:45.160 --> 28:47.940
She melted into a pool of blood
and perished.

28:53.510 --> 28:54.290
It's my fault.

28:55.830 --> 28:57.010
We should've listened to you

28:58.070 --> 28:59.090
and run when we knew we couldn't win.

29:01.510 --> 29:02.290
We really couldn't win.

29:03.310 --> 29:04.090
We really couldn't.

29:05.270 --> 29:06.050
Senior.

29:09.310 --> 29:10.090
It is nothing.

29:10.400 --> 29:11.330
It's fine.

29:11.480 --> 29:13.290
Yunxiao, it's nothing.

29:13.680 --> 29:14.700
I'm fine.

29:14.880 --> 29:15.660
It's just a scratch.

29:15.680 --> 29:16.380
Senior!

29:21.310 --> 29:24.530
The Great Calamity has begun.
No one can stop it.

29:24.920 --> 29:28.090
All in Seizing Sect will fall.

29:28.310 --> 29:29.730
None shall survive.

29:30.720 --> 29:31.250
This

29:32.070 --> 29:33.810
is the Fated Mandate.

29:34.920 --> 29:36.290
With me here,

29:37.590 --> 29:38.490
who'd dare do this?

29:45.350 --> 29:46.460
If demons seek my end,

29:46.920 --> 29:48.090
I'll purge demons.

29:48.640 --> 29:49.860
If deities seek my end,

29:50.200 --> 29:51.420
I'll slay the deities.

29:51.680 --> 29:52.490
If heaven wants me dead,

29:53.160 --> 29:54.460
I'll shatter heaven.

29:56.550 --> 29:59.180
My fate isn't up to you.

30:00.310 --> 30:01.620
It's up to me.

30:14.920 --> 30:15.700
Yunxiao.

30:17.510 --> 30:18.290
Little rascal.

30:20.640 --> 30:21.420
Are you alright?

30:22.000 --> 30:22.770
I'm fine.

30:23.960 --> 30:24.770
I'm sorry.

30:25.350 --> 30:26.770
I shouldn't have let you go alone.

30:28.920 --> 30:29.700
Don't worry.

30:30.110 --> 30:31.570
I've overcome all inner demons.

30:35.830 --> 30:36.620
Really?

30:36.960 --> 30:37.900
You're not...

30:38.590 --> 30:40.330
Oh, your weakness

30:40.590 --> 30:42.220
is this man.

30:42.240 --> 30:42.980
You...

30:58.590 --> 31:00.180
That's not Lotus Hall!

31:02.110 --> 31:02.900
That's...

31:04.480 --> 31:06.810
That's the Rank-XII Golden Lotus!

31:50.160 --> 31:50.940
Si'er.

31:57.680 --> 31:59.530
Mermaid Princess Jiang Si'er,

32:02.310 --> 32:03.490
please accept my bow.

32:03.640 --> 32:04.290
Your Highness.

32:04.310 --> 32:05.090
Let me finish.

32:07.510 --> 32:08.530
If not for you today,

32:10.310 --> 32:11.250
I don't know how much longer

32:11.270 --> 32:12.290
I would've been under their control.

32:13.400 --> 32:14.700
You've done me a great service.

32:16.270 --> 32:17.250
But

32:19.510 --> 32:20.700
I don't know how much

32:22.110 --> 32:23.700
you've suffered for my sake
all these years.

32:29.680 --> 32:30.530
But rest assured.

32:32.310 --> 32:33.490
I'll repay you

32:35.880 --> 32:37.330
a hundredfold, a thousandfold.

32:41.000 --> 32:41.770
Your Highness.

32:45.510 --> 32:46.900
The man I see before me today

32:47.750 --> 32:50.490
is the First Prince
of the East Sea I once loved.

32:57.750 --> 32:58.860
Let's break out of here together

32:59.550 --> 33:00.380
and save the East Sea.

33:03.270 --> 33:04.050
Sure.

33:04.310 --> 33:05.220
Let's go find Father

33:05.960 --> 33:06.940
and report everything.

33:11.270 --> 33:12.090
Your Highness.

33:16.310 --> 33:17.660
Where might you be going?

33:18.070 --> 33:18.810
Your Highness.

33:19.030 --> 33:20.380
He was the one who took me.

33:20.920 --> 33:22.010
The one behind it all.

33:24.200 --> 33:25.460
Where is Jinli?

33:25.720 --> 33:27.490
You mean your planted turncoat?

33:28.000 --> 33:28.980
His cover was blown.

33:29.720 --> 33:31.570
I dealt with him on the spot.

33:32.270 --> 33:33.810
Such a pity.

33:35.480 --> 33:37.010
Our grand plan was nearly done.

33:37.830 --> 33:39.860
Yet he fell at the last moment.

33:42.550 --> 33:43.730
Still,

33:44.200 --> 33:45.530
it changes little.

33:48.720 --> 33:50.570
The Eye of the Sea will open.

33:51.160 --> 33:52.380
All of you

33:53.510 --> 33:55.140
are doomed.

33:56.680 --> 33:57.490
Do you know

33:58.310 --> 34:00.140
what opening the Eye of the Sea means?

34:01.310 --> 34:03.250
All living beings will perish.

34:04.240 --> 34:06.290
Heaven and earth will shatter.

34:06.310 --> 34:07.420
Knowing this,

34:08.440 --> 34:09.650
why do you still insist on that?

34:09.670 --> 34:10.420
Because

34:11.480 --> 34:12.820
this is heaven's will.

34:13.550 --> 34:14.940
Your Highness, waste no words.

34:15.070 --> 34:16.210
I'll hold him here.

34:16.280 --> 34:17.170
Go to the Crystal Palace

34:17.190 --> 34:18.090
and save the Little Prince.

34:19.000 --> 34:19.780
Ao Yi?

34:23.710 --> 34:24.610
Too late.

34:25.000 --> 34:25.900
Ao Yi

34:27.480 --> 34:28.570
is already gone.

34:32.400 --> 34:33.170
Ao Yi.

34:47.400 --> 34:48.900
Can you truly save him?

34:48.920 --> 34:50.490
I've used my exclusive Heartward Spell

34:50.510 --> 34:51.490
to protect his heart.

34:51.840 --> 34:53.170
He's safe for now.

34:53.230 --> 34:54.490
Then why isn't he waking up?

34:56.670 --> 34:57.690
The blade was cursed.

34:57.710 --> 34:59.820
Being struck by it causes a coma.

34:59.840 --> 35:01.570
If the curse isn't broken
within two hours,

35:02.280 --> 35:03.460
his life will be in danger.

35:03.480 --> 35:05.090
Senior, don't be so calm.

35:05.110 --> 35:06.170
Hurry and break the curse!

35:06.320 --> 35:08.340
It's hard to break from outside.

35:08.510 --> 35:09.900
It requires
the Little Prince's own will.

35:09.920 --> 35:11.170
Only then is there a slim chance.

35:11.480 --> 35:12.570
His own will?

35:15.360 --> 35:16.460
He must have

35:16.710 --> 35:18.130
the will to survive.

35:20.710 --> 35:22.130
Someone, please save me.

35:23.800 --> 35:25.530
Someone, save me.

35:27.360 --> 35:28.380
Father.

35:29.000 --> 35:29.740
Jia.

35:30.360 --> 35:31.170
Senior.

35:32.880 --> 35:34.300
Can anyone save me?

35:36.880 --> 35:37.820
No one

35:38.320 --> 35:40.460
can save you.

35:40.550 --> 35:42.050
Master Jin Chan.

35:42.190 --> 35:43.050
Jin Chan.

35:43.880 --> 35:44.690
Master Jin Chan.

35:44.710 --> 35:46.690
Master Jin Chan, save me.

35:47.280 --> 35:48.300
Your Highness,

35:48.760 --> 35:50.900
you've fallen into Avici Hell.

35:51.510 --> 35:52.860
No one can save you.

35:54.030 --> 35:54.900
Impossible.

35:55.710 --> 35:56.490
Impossible.

35:57.000 --> 35:58.340
My father is
an Empyreal Aureate Immortal.

35:58.360 --> 35:59.490
He can surely save me.

35:59.510 --> 36:00.130
Yi.

36:00.150 --> 36:01.820
You still haven't grown up.

36:01.840 --> 36:03.300
You've greatly disappointed me.

36:03.320 --> 36:04.050
Father.

36:04.360 --> 36:04.900
I... I...

36:05.150 --> 36:07.170
I've always wanted to revive
the Dragon Palace, Father!

36:07.190 --> 36:08.780
You bear the Dragon's Prophecy.

36:08.920 --> 36:10.740
I once had hope for you.

36:10.760 --> 36:11.490
But you...

36:12.510 --> 36:14.170
You've greatly disappointed me.

36:14.190 --> 36:14.860
Father.

36:14.880 --> 36:15.940
You've greatly disappointed me.

36:15.960 --> 36:18.210
You've greatly disappointed me.

36:18.920 --> 36:19.690
Father.

36:20.280 --> 36:21.050
Father.

36:21.230 --> 36:23.860
You want to revive the Dragon Clan?

36:24.510 --> 36:25.260
Jia.

36:27.920 --> 36:28.300
Jia.

36:28.320 --> 36:29.380
I'm not your brother.

36:29.510 --> 36:30.740
You conspired with outsiders

36:31.360 --> 36:32.490
to harm me,

36:32.510 --> 36:34.610
with no regard for our brotherly bond.

36:34.630 --> 36:37.260
I've wasted years caring for you

36:37.280 --> 36:38.260
and protecting you.

36:38.280 --> 36:39.380
That's not true.

36:39.480 --> 36:40.780
I was a fool to trust you.

36:41.480 --> 36:43.300
Jia, just let me explain.

36:44.190 --> 36:45.300
You lied to me.

36:48.320 --> 36:49.090
Senior.

36:49.320 --> 36:50.490
Don't call me Senior.

36:51.360 --> 36:52.690
You vile dragon!

36:52.710 --> 36:54.490
Your clan wiped out my whole clan.

36:55.280 --> 36:57.530
And now, you dare pose
as my Little Uncle?

36:59.320 --> 37:00.090
Senior.

37:04.150 --> 37:06.420
I've been looking for you, Senior.

37:07.710 --> 37:08.490
Looking for me?

37:09.710 --> 37:11.530
You were marrying Si'er
in the Dragon Palace.

37:11.550 --> 37:12.570
Where would you've found me?

37:15.510 --> 37:16.740
You didn't come to me.

37:18.760 --> 37:19.900
So, I came to you.

37:22.590 --> 37:23.380
Alright?

37:45.150 --> 37:46.090
Why?

37:47.510 --> 37:48.420
Why?

37:49.150 --> 37:50.260
You've greatly disappointed me.

37:50.280 --> 37:51.300
You're so ungrateful.

37:51.320 --> 37:52.490
You liar!

37:52.510 --> 37:52.940
Senior.

37:52.960 --> 37:54.340
You've greatly disappointed me.

37:54.360 --> 37:54.690
Father.

37:54.710 --> 37:55.900
Ungrateful!

37:55.920 --> 37:56.420
Jia.

37:56.440 --> 37:57.300
You are a liar.

37:57.320 --> 37:58.780
You've greatly disappointed me.

37:58.800 --> 37:59.570
Ungrateful!

37:59.590 --> 38:01.300
That's not true.

38:01.320 --> 38:02.980
You liar! Liar!

38:03.230 --> 38:04.740
You've greatly disappointed me.

38:04.760 --> 38:05.490
You liar!

38:05.510 --> 38:06.010
Ungrateful!

38:06.030 --> 38:07.570
You've greatly disappointed me.

38:07.590 --> 38:08.010
Liar!

38:08.030 --> 38:08.420
Senior.

38:08.440 --> 38:08.900
Liar!

38:10.000 --> 38:11.210
No!

38:13.840 --> 38:14.530
Senior.

38:18.440 --> 38:20.780
Have you considered

38:21.480 --> 38:22.460
who brought all of this

38:23.190 --> 38:25.170
upon you?

38:25.710 --> 38:28.570
Trust yourself. You can do it.

38:28.920 --> 38:29.780
Who lured you

38:30.920 --> 38:33.090
away from East Sea

38:33.480 --> 38:35.380
and drew you back again?

38:36.360 --> 38:40.420
Who made you brothers turn
on each other?

38:40.480 --> 38:42.610
Did I hurt Jia?

38:43.760 --> 38:44.900
You two

38:44.920 --> 38:47.570
will have time to make amends.

38:47.590 --> 38:48.460
Right now,

38:48.510 --> 38:51.210
we must make use of this victory.

38:51.230 --> 38:52.300
Who stopped you

38:52.800 --> 38:54.900
from seeking your senior?

38:55.510 --> 38:58.050
When you become King of East Sea,

38:58.070 --> 38:59.090
with Celestial Court behind you,

38:59.110 --> 39:01.210
finding one person will be easy.

39:01.960 --> 39:03.340
And who stripped

39:03.630 --> 39:05.940
your spiritual power

39:06.400 --> 39:08.300
and made you suffer so much?

39:09.030 --> 39:10.980
Why is this spot so hard to wash?

39:12.070 --> 39:12.650
It's fine.

39:13.230 --> 39:14.900
I have deep-clean mode.

39:19.630 --> 39:20.420
Here it comes.

39:31.480 --> 39:32.570
How can this be?

39:38.150 --> 39:39.090
How

39:40.960 --> 39:42.170
could it be him?

40:15.330 --> 40:21.110
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

40:21.780 --> 40:28.480
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

40:30.010 --> 40:36.060
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

40:36.690 --> 40:43.140
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

40:43.880 --> 40:51.000
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

40:51.380 --> 40:58.280
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

40:58.660 --> 41:06.010
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

41:06.010 --> 41:13.180
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

41:29.320 --> 41:34.490
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

41:35.580 --> 41:42.600
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

41:43.790 --> 41:49.730
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

41:50.430 --> 41:57.510
♪Alas, our story is short♪

41:57.850 --> 42:04.960
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

42:05.280 --> 42:11.760
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

42:12.540 --> 42:19.750
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

42:20.140 --> 42:27.960
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
